ty — a confidential meeting, an\nair-gapped machine, or simply a preference not to rent your own voice.\n\nIt also transcribes recordings (`yazses transcribe talk.m4a`, with optional\nspeaker labels) and can capture a whole meeting into a speaker-labelled\ntranscript with locally generated minutes.","moniker":"yazses","name":"YazSes","packageUrl":"https://mskazemi.com/yazses/","publisher":"MSKazemi","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/releases/tag/v2.38.0","tags":["voice","dictation","voice-typing","speech-to-text","speech-recognition","whisper","transcription","offline","on-device","privacy","accessibility","productivity","open-source"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi","releaseDate":"2026-09-24","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/MSKazemi/yazses/releases/tag/v2.38.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.6.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.38.0/MSKazemi.YazSes.yaml","sha256":"fe0aa1433189dfe4259ddee10bcfc157e561003cd8706b54c1a75c19816e0419"},{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.38.0/MSKazemi.YazSes.installer.yaml","sha256":"00816cdabd652a910c8377c2f085b8ab00c9b96dba14863d26e382e49e1bdde1"},{"path":"manifests/m/MSKazemi/YazSes/2.38.0/MSKazemi.YazSes.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"8d50d8791a533357ffd7f10a8cfde912eba3e4d669ca6070b0073e53939cf2ea"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"2.38.0"}